      <p><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-475-523"><seg source="#source-469-475">こい</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-499-508">（恋）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-523-526">わ</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-535-589"><seg source="#source-526-535">しはん</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-562-574">（思案）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-589-610">のほかとやら　</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-619-673"><seg source="#source-610-619">あなど</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-646-658">（長門）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-673-685">のせとの</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-700-763"><seg source="#source-685-700">いなりまち</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-733-748">（稲荷町）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-763-817">　ねこもしやくしもおもしろふ　あそぶ</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-826-877"><seg source="#source-817-826">くるわ</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-853-862">（廓）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-877-880">の</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-895-958"><seg source="#source-880-895">はるげしき</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-928-943">（春景色）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-958-982">　ここにひとりの</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-997-1060"><seg source="#source-982-997">さるまハし</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-1030-1045">（猿廻し）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-1060-1072">　たぬき</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-1084-1141"><seg source="#source-1072-1084">いつぴき</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-1114-1126">（一匹）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-1141-1162">ふりすてゝ　義</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-1165-1210"><seg source="#source-1162-1165">利</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-1186-1195">（理）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-1210-1231">もなさけもなき</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-1240-1291"><seg source="#source-1231-1240">なみだ</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-1267-1276">（涙）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-1291-1399">　ほかにこゝろハあるまいと　かけてちかいし山の神　うちにいるのにこゝろの</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-1408-1462"><seg source="#source-1399-1408">やみぢ</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-1435-1447">（闇路）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-1462-1474">　さぐり</seg><choice source="#source-1474-1480"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-1480-1504">て　いでゝ行</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1504-1636">とんとんと登る梯子の真中程で　国を去つて薩摩同志　楼に上る貧乏の春　辛抱しやんせと目に涙</seg></p>
    </body>
